description: Never add agent attribution to commits, PRs, code or docs
alwaysApply: true
---

# No agent git attribution

- Do not add `Co-Authored-By: Claude`, `Generated with Claude Code`, `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, `Made-with: Cursor`, or any other agent trailer/mark to commits, PR bodies, code or docs.
- Commits and PRs must use the human author's identity only.
- If tooling injects an agent trailer, remove it before finishing the commit/PR.
- Commit format and branch rules are in the root `AGENTS.md` (Git workflow).
